<div class="mx-auto flex max-w-6xl flex-col gap-10 px-4 py-12">
  <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-4 text-slate-200">
    <div class="space-y-2">
      <p class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.45em] text-brand-gold">Confirm Reservation</p>
      <h1 class="font-heading text-3xl text-white md:text-4xl"><%= @movie.name %></h1>
      <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-4 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.3em] text-slate-500">
        <span><%= Date.parse(@date.to_s).strftime('%Y.%m.%d') rescue @date %></span>
        <span><%= @schedule.start_time.strftime('%H:%M') %> - <%= @schedule.end_time.strftime('%H:%M') %></span>
        <span>Screen <%= @schedule.screen_id %></span>
        <span>Seat <%= "#{@sheet.row.upcase}-#{@sheet.column}" %></span>
      </div>
    </div>
    <%= link_to '座席選択に戻る', reservation_movie_path(@movie, schedule_id: @schedule.id, date: @date), class: 'btn-secondary text-xs sm:text-sm' %>
  </div>

  <div class="grid gap-6 lg:grid-cols-3">
    <aside class="rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-slate-900/60 p-6 text-sm text-slate-300 shadow-lg">
      <p class="font-semibold text-brand-gold">予約内容</p>
      <dl class="mt-4 space-y-3 text-slate-200">
        <div class="flex justify-between gap-3 text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.25em] text-slate-500">
          <span>座席</span>
          <span><%= "#{@sheet.row.upcase}-#{@sheet.column}" %></span>
        </div>
        <div class="flex justify-between gap-3 text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.25em] text-slate-500">
          <span>上映日</span>
          <span><%= Date.parse(@date.to_s).strftime('%Y/%m/%d') rescue @date %></span>
        </div>
        <div class="flex justify-between gap-3 text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.25em] text-slate-500">
          <span>時間</span>
          <span><%= @schedule.start_time.strftime('%H:%M') %>〜<%= @schedule.end_time.strftime('%H:%M') %></span>
        </div>
        <div class="flex justify-between gap-3 text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.25em] text-slate-500">
          <span>スクリーン</span>
          <span><%= @schedule.screen_id %></span>
        </div>
      </dl>
      <p class="mt-6 leading-relaxed text-slate-400">
        予約を確定すると登録済みメールアドレスへ確認メールをお送りします。内容に誤りがないかご確認ください。
      </p>
    </aside>

    <div class="lg:col-span-2 space-y-6">
      <div class="rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-slate-900/60 p-6 shadow-lg">
        <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-soft">予約者情報</h2>
        <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-slate-400">ログイン中のアカウント情報を使用します。変更が必要な場合はプロフィールを更新してください。</p>

        <%= form_with model: @reservation, url: reservations_path, local: true, class: 'form-stack mt-6' do |f| %>
          <%= f.hidden_field :schedule_id, value: @schedule.id %>
          <%= f.hidden_field :sheet_id, value: @sheet.id %>
          <%= f.hidden_field :date, value: @date %>
          <%= f.hidden_field :screen_id, value: @schedule.screen_id %>

          <div class="form-field">
            <%= f.label :name, '予約者氏名', class: 'form-label' %>
            <%= f.text_field :name, value: current_user.name, readonly: true, class: 'form-input' %>
          </div>

          <div class="form-field">
            <%= f.label :email, '予約者メールアドレス', class: 'form-label' %>
            <%= f.email_field :email, value: current_user.email, readonly: true, class: 'form-input' %>
          </div>

          <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-3 pt-4">
            <%= f.submit '予約を確定する', class: 'btn-primary w-full sm:w-auto justify-center' %>
          </div>
        <% end %>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
